From 31684cdbc4de477cc620b53550d33ea396a178ce Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: rodin-ia <38556724+rodin-ia@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 6 Aug 2026 00:53:08 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] hwdb: Add HP EliteBook 845 G7 Fn+F11 airplane mode key
 mapping

Add a hwdb entry for the HP EliteBook 845 G7 laptop.

The Fn+F11 airplane mode key is reported as KEY_F8 by the atkbd
driver. Map it to !wlan to expose the correct wireless radio switch
event to userspace.

(cherry picked from commit f807a6f26d150d9e8138ef59d2ff2c9c7e860d39)

Related: RHEL-72703
---
 hwdb.d/60-keyboard.hwdb | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/hwdb.d/60-keyboard.hwdb b/hwdb.d/60-keyboard.hwdb
index 7360696f2e..630638ba35 100644
--- a/hwdb.d/60-keyboard.hwdb
+++ b/hwdb.d/60-keyboard.hwdb
@@ -868,6 +868,7 @@ evdev:atkbd:dmi:bvn*:bvr*:bd*:svnHP:pnHPEliteBookFolioG1:*
 # HP EliteBook 845 G7
 evdev:atkbd:dmi:bvn*:bvr*:bd*:svnHP*:pnHPEliteBook845G7*:pvr*
  KEYBOARD_KEY_68=unknown                                # Fn+F12 HP Programmable Key
+ KEYBOARD_KEY_f8=!wlan                                  # Fn+F11 airplane mode switch 
 
 # HP ProBook 650
 evdev:atkbd:dmi:bvn*:bvr*:bd*:svnHewlett-Packard*:pnHP*ProBook*650*:*
